The 156 ProbNNN_*_ref.sv files under refs/ are the SystemVerilog references of
NVIDIA's verilog-eval dataset, dataset_spec-to-rtl (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023-2024 NVIDIA
Research Projects; see https://github.com/NVlabs/verilog-eval). They are copied from the dataset
(the repository's pre-commit hook drops the trailing blank line at end of file) and are the
v1.1.0 SystemVerilog front end's coverage corpus: manifest.tsv pins each design's expected
outcome through the SV gate flow, and tests/cli/veval_corpus.sh checks it in ctest.

